<p><input id="obj964-1" name="obj964-1" type="hidden" value=""><input id="obj964-2" name="obj964-2" type="hidden" value=""><input id="obj964-3" name="obj964-3" type="hidden" value=""><input id="obj964-4" name="obj964-4" type="hidden" value="N"></p>c:T53e,<p>Artigos 42 a 48 do RICMS/99, aprovado pelo Decreto n&ordm; 20.686/99.</p>
<p><input id="obj964-2" name="obj964-2" type="hidden" value=""><input id="obj964-3" name="obj964-3" type="hidden" value=""></p>
